### Stock (E4-02). Local server: cd server && npm run dev
# Needs the seed: cd server && npx sequelize db:seed:all
# Log in first (http/auth.http); the token of the Owner goes into @token below.
@token = paste-the-token-here
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# IDs from the list answers (GET /api/warehouses and GET /api/products):
@warehouseId = paste-a-warehouse-id-here
@productId = paste-a-product-id-here
# A new UUID each time you want a new receipt. Sending the SAME one again is a replay.
@key = 7b0d6a54-1f0e-4a39-9a1c-5d2f8c3e4b10

### Receive stock (Owner, or Warehouse Admin of an assigned warehouse)
# Expect 201 { id, warehouseId, productId, quantity, createdAt } (the movement, not the balance).
# Send it again with the same Idempotency-Key: the same 201 body plus the header Idempotency-Replayed: true,
# and no second movement.
# 400 VALIDATION_ERROR: no or malformed Idempotency-Key, quantity outside 1..1000000, note over 255 characters, unknown field.
# 403 FORBIDDEN: a Viewer, or a warehouse that is unassigned, archived, foreign or missing (one body).
# 404 NOT_FOUND: a product that is foreign or missing. 409 CONFLICT: an archived product, or the stock would pass 2147483647.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": "{{warehouseId}}", "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 25, "note": "PO-2026-001" }

### Missing Idempotency-Key
# Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details [{ "source": "header", "path": "Idempotency-Key", "message": "Wajib diisi." }]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": "{{warehouseId}}", "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 }

### Adjust stock (Owner, or Warehouse Admin of an assigned warehouse)
# mode SET: "value" is the counted quantity (0..1000000). mode DELTA: "value" is a non-zero difference (-1000000..1000000).
# reason: STOCK_OPNAME, DAMAGED, LOST or CORRECTION (required). note: optional, at most 255 characters.
# Expect 201 { id, warehouseId, productId, quantity (the SIGNED change), createdAt, reason }. A repeated Idempotency-Key gives
# the same body plus Idempotency-Replayed: true.
# 400: a new quantity equal to the current one ("Stok baru sama dengan stok saat ini (n)."), or bad input.
# 403 (one body): a Viewer, or an unassigned, archived, foreign or missing warehouse. 404: a foreign or missing product.
# 409: the result would be below 0 or above 2147483647; the warehouse was archived meanwhile; "Stok berubah saat disesuaikan. Coba lagi."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 0c9b6f2e-5d77-4b0a-8c1e-2a6d93f1b7a4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouseId": "{{warehouseId}}", "productId": "{{productId}}", "mode": "SET", "value": 40, "reason": "STOCK_OPNAME", "note": "Hitung ulang rak A" }

### Stock summary (every tenant role)
# One row per (warehouse, product) pair that HAS a stock row. Query (all optional): warehouseId, productId, q (SKU or name),
# status (OUT, LOW, OK), page, pageSize (max 100).
# Expect 200 { items: [{ warehouse, product, quantity, status, updatedAt }], total, page, pageSize, summary: { out, low, ok } }.
# 400 for a malformed id, an unknown status or paging out of range. 403 for a warehouseId the caller cannot reach (one body).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock?status=LOW&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock history (every tenant role; only the caller's warehouses)
# Newest first, 50 rows a page. Query (all optional): productId, warehouseId (out of reach gives an empty list, not 403), type,
# createdById, from (inclusive) and to (exclusive) as ISO 8601 instants WITH an offset, cursor (the nextCursor of the previous page).
# Expect 200 { items: [{ id, warehouseId, productId, type, quantityDelta, reason, note, transferId, createdById, createdAt }], nextCursor }.
# 400 for a malformed id, an unknown type, a bad instant or a cursor that is not a nextCursor.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?type=RECEIVE&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00%2B07:00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One movement (every tenant role; the movement's warehouse must be one of the caller's)
# Expect 200: the list item plus warehouse { id, code, name }, product { id, sku, name, unit }, createdBy { id, name, role } | null
# and transfer { id, code, fromWarehouse { id, name }, toWarehouse { id, name } } | null. No email.
# 404 NOT_FOUND (one body) for a malformed, missing, foreign or out-of-reach id.
@movementId = paste-a-movement-id-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements/{{movementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
